      "id": "c9f5ad0d-481c-5857-8ca6-8f825048771e",
      "slug": "detail-the-truth-about-sharks",
      "title": "Reading for Detail — The Truth about Sharks",
      "library": "l2_skill",
      "status": "published",
      "body_markdown": "Few animals frighten people as much as the shark, yet very little of that fear matches\nthe facts. Sharks were already swimming in the oceans long before the first dinosaurs\nappeared, which makes them one of the oldest groups of large animals on the planet.\nFilms often show them as hungry killers, but the real numbers tell a different story.\nEach year sharks kill about ten people around the world. In the same period, humans\nkill roughly 100 million sharks, mostly for their fins and meat.\n\nA shark is not built like other fish. Its skeleton is made not from bone but from\ncartilage — the same light, bendy material found in the human ear and nose. Because\ncartilage is lighter than bone, a shark can move through the water using less energy.\n\nSharks are also remarkable hunters. As well as sharp sight and a powerful sense of\nsmell, they have special organs in the head that can sense the tiny electrical signals\ngiven off by every living animal.\n\nThere are more than 500 species of shark, from the giant whale shark to types no\nlonger than a human hand. Only a small number of these pose any danger to people at\nall. Far from being mindless monsters, sharks play a vital role: as top predators,\nthey keep the numbers of other fish in balance.",
      "metadata": {
        "grammar_focus": [
          {
            "tip": "'not … but …' tạo bẫy polarity cho True/False: bài phủ định 'bone' và khẳng định 'cartilage' → câu hỏi đảo lại sẽ là FALSE; bám đúng vế 'but'.",
            "point": "Bị động + cấu trúc tương quan 'not … but …'",
            "review": "Bị động: S + be + V3. Cấu trúc tương quan: not A but B (không phải A mà B), cân đối hai vế cùng dạng (here: from + N).",
            "example": "Its skeleton **is made not from bone but from** cartilage",
            "analysis": "'is made' = bị động hiện tại đơn (be + V3). Cặp tương quan 'not from bone but from cartilage' đối lập hai lựa chọn: phủ định cái thứ nhất, khẳng định cái thứ hai. 'not A but B' = không phải A mà là B."
