                {
                  "source": "attention",
                  "target": "sự chú ý"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "p4-s2",
              "source": "Asking a person merely to watch a process that mostly runs well is asking for something humans do badly: maintaining unbroken vigilance over long stretches with nothing to do.",
