      "library": "l1_vocab",
      "status": "published",
      "body_markdown": "What animal will fight a lion? The honey **badger** will. This is a small animal. It is\nonly the size of a small dog. But it is very **fearless**. It does not run away from\nbig animals.\n\nThe honey badger has very thick **skin**. The skin on its neck is very **thick**. Its\nskin is also **loose**. So it can turn inside its own skin. Then it can **bite** the\nanimal that holds it. This clever trick helps it get away from danger.\n\nThis animal eats many kinds of **snake**. Snake **venom** does not kill it easily. It can\neat very dangerous snakes too. Some of these snakes can kill a person with one bite.\nBut the honey badger is fine. After a sleep, it wakes up and looks for more food.\n\nThis animal also loves to eat **honey**. It will dig into a bee nest to find it. That is\nwhy it has its name. It is a small animal with a big heart.",
