      "id": "da14955d-00d8-568e-8dce-2b04947f0897",
      "slug": "the-story-of-jeans",
      "title": "The Story of Blue Jeans",
      "library": "l1_vocab",
      "status": "published",
      "body_markdown": "In 1873, two men received a small piece of paper that would change the way the world dressed. One was Jacob Davis, a **tailor** in Nevada; the other was Levi Strauss, a cloth seller in San Francisco.\n\nThe idea had begun with a problem. Davis made strong trousers for a **miner** whose wife complained that ordinary work trousers would always **tear** at the pockets. Davis decided to fix the weak spots with small metal **rivets**, placing them exactly where the cloth took the most **strain**, such as the pocket corners.\n\nThe trick worked so well that Davis wanted to protect it, but he had no money for the paperwork. He wrote to Levi Strauss, who supplied his cloth, and the two agreed to share a **patent**. Their riveted trousers, made from blue denim, proved far more **durable** than anything else on the market.\n\nAt first these trousers were simply **workwear** for miners, farmers and railway builders. Over the following decades, however, they slowly entered everyday life, and by the middle of the twentieth century jeans had become a symbol of **fashion** for the young. The **brand** Levi's grew famous worldwide.\n\nFrom a tailor's workshop, blue jeans seem to have **spread** across the globe. The full reasons behind their lasting appeal remain hard to pin down.",
      "metadata": {
        "grammar_focus": [
          {
            "tip": "Thấy 'whose + danh từ' hãy nối ngược lên người/vật đứng trước để hiểu 'của ai' — tránh nhầm chủ thể trong câu dài.",
            "point": "Mệnh đề quan hệ với 'whose' chỉ sự sở hữu",
            "review": "whose + N + V… = của ai (sở hữu). Khác who (chủ ngữ) và whom (tân ngữ); 'whose' luôn đi liền một danh từ ngay sau.",
            "example": "Davis made strong trousers for a miner **whose wife** complained that ordinary work trousers would always tear…",
            "analysis": "'whose' thay cho 'of the miner', chỉ quan hệ sở hữu: 'whose wife' = vợ của người thợ mỏ. Sau 'whose' luôn là một danh từ (wife) rồi đến động từ (complained). Mệnh đề bổ nghĩa cho 'a miner'."
