      "question_type": "summary_completion",
      "prompt": "Complete the summary. Choose ONE WORD ONLY from the passage for each gap.\n\nA camera works much like the human eye. The amount of light entering is set by the\naperture, while the (4) __________ decides how long that light is allowed in. A\nlong opening time blurs anything that is (5) __________, which is why fast subjects\nneed a brief one. Older cameras recorded the picture on (6) __________, but modern\nones use a digital sensor instead.",
